  m_text: 'On your left you will see a few buttons numbered 1 to 9 as well as another
    that says clear image.


    Each number represents one of the finger flutings
    we want you to make.


    If you make a mistake or something goes wrong while
    making a finger fluting, press clear image and start again on that one.


    All
    the instructions that appear after this can be removed by reaching out and pressing
    the text.'
